return ['messages'=>['128212e1907f2eba62a33df16faf9fb3'=>'<span class="TextRun SCXW197297806 BCX2" lang="PT-BR" xml:lang="PT-BR" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW197297806 BCX2">The </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW197297806 BCX2">partnership</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW197297806 BCX2">began</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW197297806 BCX2">with</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW197297806 BCX2"> a </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW197297806 BCX2">clear</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW197297806 BCX2">need</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW197297806 BCX2">from</span></span> <a href="https://qonta.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Qonta</a>: <span data-contrast="auto">to quickly enable a secure, scalable payments solution aligned with regulatory requirements, which was essential to validate its business model at a strategic moment of growth. Created to facilitate access to financial services for non financial companies, the fintech was looking for more than technology. It needed a partner willing to build together.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span>','28c8c92d957e4d8c0a0b064c9e030819'=>'In an increasingly dynamic and competitive environment, reducing the time between the conception of an idea and its go live operation has become a strategic differentiator. With this objective, Evertec and Qonta joined forces to structure and launch a complete payments operation in just 21 days, an unprecedented timeframe for this type of implementation. ','487d605764a39a2c9b551b9796fd6b50'=>'Throughout the process, Qonta made relevant adjustments to the initial scope, migrating its card model from prepaid to postpaid. This change required flexibility, fast alignment, and close collaboration between the technical teams, reinforcing the collaborative nature of the delivery. ','6792f85ffae8d4a966346e47808e5ee3'=>'The solution implemented was the BIN Sponsor model, which allows Qonta to operate payments using Evertec’s regulatory license and infrastructure, without the need for direct brand certification. The platform includes physical and virtual cards, as well as integration with digital wallets such as Google Pay and Apple Pay, providing a robust foundation for B2B companies to create their own payment solutions in an agile, secure, and fully integrated way. ','73f484434aa22e6e206b5aa4a0454944'=>'<a href="https://tiinside.com.br/15/01/2026/agilidade-com-proposito-como-a-evertec-e-a-qonta-transformaram-uma-ideia-em-operacao-em-21-dias/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Original article published by TI Insider</a> ','907ea21a33c2a1e2e71ec012d9d6d41a'=>'“This gesture made all the difference. We were able to test the product, address questions in real time, and gain a much deeper understanding of how the platform works. It was a practical demonstration of true partnership, not just technology delivery.” <br>','<a href="https://tiinside.com.br/15/01/2026/agilidade-com-proposito-como-a-evertec-e-a-qonta-transformaram-uma-ideia-em-operacao-em-21-dias/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Artículo original publicado en TI Insider</a> '=>'<a href="https://tiinside.com.br/15/01/2026/agilidade-com-proposito-como-a-evertec-e-a-qonta-transformaram-uma-ideia-em-operacao-em-21-dias/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Original article published by TI Insider</a> ','<strong>Milton Camargo</strong>, fundador y CEO de QONTA'=>'<strong><span class="TextRun SCXW215826342 BCX2" lang="PT-BR" xml:lang="PT-BR" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW215826342 BCX2">Milton Camargo</span></span></strong><span class="TextRun SCXW215826342 BCX2" lang="PT-BR" xml:lang="PT-BR" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW215826342 BCX2">, </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW215826342 BCX2">Founder</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW215826342 BCX2">and</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW215826342 BCX2"> CEO </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW215826342 BCX2">of</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW215826342 BCX2"> QONTA</span></span>','Del lado de Evertec, líder en tecnología financiera en América Latina y el Caribe, el proyecto representó la oportunidad de aplicar en la práctica un modelo de relacionamiento basado en cercanía, escucha activa y colaboración técnica desde los primeros contactos. Incluso antes de la formalización contractual, el equipo de Pagos de Evertec habilitó un entorno sandbox, permitiendo que el equipo de Qonta probara las APIs, explorara la documentación y validara integraciones con anticipación. '=>'From Evertec’s perspective, a leader in financial technology across Latin America and the Caribbean, the project represented an opportunity to put into practice a relationship model based on proximity, active listening, and technical collaboration from the very first interactions. Even before the contract was formally signed, Evertec’s Payments team provided access to a sandbox environment, allowing Qonta’s team to test APIs, explore technical documentation, and validate integrations in advance. ','Durante el proceso, Qonta realizó ajustes relevantes en el alcance inicial, migrando el modelo de tarjetas de prepago a pospago. Este cambio exigió flexibilidad, rápida alineación y trabajo conjunto entre los equipos técnicos, reforzando el carácter colaborativo de la entrega. '=>'Throughout the process, Qonta made relevant adjustments to the initial scope, migrating its card model from prepaid to postpaid. This change required flexibility, fast alignment, and close collaboration between the technical teams, reinforcing the collaborative nature of the delivery. ','En un entorno cada vez más dinámico y competitivo, reducir el tiempo entre la concepción de una idea y su puesta en operación se ha convertido en un diferencial estratégico. Con este objetivo, Evertec y Qonta unieron esfuerzos para estructurar y poner en marcha una operación de pagos completa en apenas 21 días, un plazo inédito para este tipo de implementación. '=>'In an increasingly dynamic and competitive environment, reducing the time between the conception of an idea and its go live operation has become a strategic differentiator. With this objective, Evertec and Qonta joined forces to structure and launch a complete payments operation in just 21 days, an unprecedented timeframe for this type of implementation. ','Este enfoque anticipado aceleró decisiones técnicas, redujo riesgos y fortaleció la confianza entre los equipos. El proyecto inició oficialmente a comienzos de septiembre y, en solo veintiún días, Qonta realizó su primera transacción en producción, superando los plazos históricos internos de Evertec para implementaciones similares. '=>'This early approach accelerated technical decision making, reduced risks, and strengthened trust between the teams. The project officially kicked off in early September and, in just twenty one days, Qonta completed its first live transaction, surpassing Evertec’s internal historical timelines for similar implementations. ','La alianza surgió a partir de una necesidad clara de <a href="https://qonta.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Qonta</a>: viabilizar rápidamente una solución de pagos segura, escalable y alineada con los requerimientos regulatorios, fundamental para validar su modelo de negocio en un momento estratégico de crecimiento. Creada para facilitar el acceso de empresas no financieras a servicios financieros, la fintech buscaba más que tecnología. Necesitaba un socio dispuesto a construir en conjunto. '=>'<span class="TextRun SCXW197297806 BCX2" lang="PT-BR" xml:lang="PT-BR" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW197297806 BCX2">The </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW197297806 BCX2">partnership</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW197297806 BCX2">began</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW197297806 BCX2">with</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW197297806 BCX2"> a </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW197297806 BCX2">clear</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW197297806 BCX2">need</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW197297806 BCX2">from</span></span> <a href="https://qonta.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Qonta</a>: <span data-contrast="auto">to quickly enable a secure, scalable payments solution aligned with regulatory requirements, which was essential to validate its business model at a strategic moment of growth. Created to facilitate access to financial services for non financial companies, the fintech was looking for more than technology. It needed a partner willing to build together.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span>','La solución adoptada fue el modelo de BIN Sponsor, que permite a Qonta operar pagos utilizando la licencia regulatoria y la infraestructura de Evertec, sin necesidad de homologación directa con la marca. La plataforma incluye tarjetas físicas y virtuales, además de integración con billeteras digitales como Google Pay y Apple Pay, ofreciendo una base robusta para que empresas B2B creen sus propios medios de pago de forma ágil, segura e integrada. '=>'More than a technical delivery, the project became an internal reference for how genuine collaboration can transform timelines, processes, and outcomes. With the operation now live, Qonta continues to expand its financial services offering, while Evertec reinforces its position as a strategic partner for businesses that need to evolve with speed and security. ','Más que una entrega técnica, el proyecto se convirtió en una referencia interna de cómo la colaboración genuina puede transformar plazos, procesos y resultados. Con la operación ya en funcionamiento, Qonta continúa ampliando su oferta de servicios financieros, mientras Evertec refuerza su posicionamiento como socio estratégico para negocios que necesitan evolucionar con velocidad y seguridad.'=>'The solution implemented was the BIN Sponsor model, which allows Qonta to operate payments using Evertec’s regulatory license and infrastructure, without the need for direct brand certification. The platform includes physical and virtual cards, as well as integration with digital wallets such as Google Pay and Apple Pay, providing a robust foundation for B2B companies to create their own payment solutions in an agile, secure, and fully integrated way. ','a26c2c7aaf0d54034754dff9ef3777f5'=>'<strong><span class="TextRun SCXW215826342 BCX2" lang="PT-BR" xml:lang="PT-BR" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW215826342 BCX2">Milton Camargo</span></span></strong><span class="TextRun SCXW215826342 BCX2" lang="PT-BR" xml:lang="PT-BR" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW215826342 BCX2">, </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW215826342 BCX2">Founder</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW215826342 BCX2">and</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW215826342 BCX2"> CEO </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW215826342 BCX2">of</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW215826342 BCX2"> QONTA</span></span>','b977ab94ed0f7bd6f2661729121f1d78'=>'This early approach accelerated technical decision making, reduced risks, and strengthened trust between the teams. The project officially kicked off in early September and, in just twenty one days, Qonta completed its first live transaction, surpassing Evertec’s internal historical timelines for similar implementations. ','de991dae51ef49b1bddbd3acaf0e5d58'=>'From Evertec’s perspective, a leader in financial technology across Latin America and the Caribbean, the project represented an opportunity to put into practice a relationship model based on proximity, active listening, and technical collaboration from the very first interactions. Even before the contract was formally signed, Evertec’s Payments team provided access to a sandbox environment, allowing Qonta’s team to test APIs, explore technical documentation, and validate integrations in advance. ','e3058f8e671ba9ed9b5478bca6537338'=>'More than a technical delivery, the project became an internal reference for how genuine collaboration can transform timelines, processes, and outcomes. With the operation now live, Qonta continues to expand its financial services offering, while Evertec reinforces its position as a strategic partner for businesses that need to evolve with speed and security. ','“Este gesto marcó toda la diferencia. Pudimos probar el producto, resolver dudas en tiempo real y comprender el funcionamiento de la plataforma de forma mucho más profunda. Fue una demostración práctica de una verdadera alianza, no solo de provisión de tecnología.”  '=>'“This gesture made all the difference. We were able to test the product, address questions in real time, and gain a much deeper understanding of how the platform works. It was a practical demonstration of true partnership, not just technology delivery.” <br>']];
